```java
class Car {                 // blueprint
    String model;           // each object gets its own model
    int speed;
    void accelerate() { speed += 10; }
}

Car a = new Car();          // object 1 on the heap
Car b = new Car();          // object 2, fully independent
a.model = "Tesla"; a.accelerate();
b.model = "Honda";
System.out.println(a.model + " " + a.speed); // Tesla 10
System.out.println(b.model + " " + b.speed); // Honda 0  (unaffected)
```

